 "scope_notes": "The function introduces Taproot descriptor creation using MuSig2 key path aggregation (musig(...)) combined with a sortedmulti_a script path.",
 "changed_since_previous": "Switched the Taproot descriptor key path from a NUMS point to an aggregated MuSig2 key expression (musig(...)/<0;1>/*).",
 "card": "Adds CreateMultisigDescriptor() to validate cosigner keys and construct ranged multipath multisig descriptors with checksums for P2WSH and Taproot (MuSig2 key path with sortedmulti_a script path). Multisig setup workflows currently lack a backend helper to safely assemble descriptors, resorting to ad-hoc string formatting that risks unvalidated thresholds, duplicate keys, or malformed derivation paths. This change provides validated descriptor construction for the multisig wizard tracked in issue #35645 and PR #36325.",
